<td width="25%" align="right"><span style="color:#999"> ► </span> <a href="/wiki/%E5%A4%A2%E6%BA%AA%E7%AD%86%E8%AB%87/%E5%8D%B723" title="梦溪笔谈/卷23">卷二十三</a><span style="display:inline-block; inline-size:1em;"></span>
